      "heading": "Ikhtisar Tutorial",
      "id": "tutorial-overview",
      "intro": "Kumpulan tutorial langkah-demi-langkah untuk menguasai Scenario Studio Canvas. Cocok untuk pengguna baru maupun yang ingin memperdalam fitur lanjutan.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuat Rule Pertama",
          "desc": "Walkthrough end-to-end: dari membuka Scenario Studio hingga submit rule pertama Anda. Pelajari cara memilih tipe rule, mengisi parameter dasar, membangun logika deteksi sederhana di canvas, dan men-submit scenario. Cocok untuk pengguna baru yang ingin langsung mencoba.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14.752 11.168l-3.197-2.132A1 1 0 0010 9.87v4.263a1 1 0 001.555.832l3.197-2.132a1 1 0 000-1.664z\"/><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg></div><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-blue-900\">End-to-End Beginner Walkthrough</p><div class=\"flex gap-2 mt-1\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-blue-100 text-blue-800\">Submit</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-green-100 text-green-800\">Baru</span></div></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Membangun Detection Flow",
          "desc": "Panduan mendalam menyusun node kondisi di canvas. Pelajari cara menghubungkan node dengan operator logika (AND/OR/NOT), mengatur parameter kondisi CONTAINS, CONSTANT, DEVIATION, dan membuat alur deteksi yang kompleks dengan multiple branch.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-white rounded-lg border border-violet-200\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-violet-800\">LOGICAL: AND</span><span class=\"text-xs text-violet-600\">Gabung 2 kondisi</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-white rounded-lg border border-violet-200\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-violet-800\">CONTAINS: email</span><span class=\"text-xs text-violet-600\">Pattern matching</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 bg-white rounded-lg border border-violet-200\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-violet-800\">DEVIATION: > 20%</span><span class=\"text-xs text-violet-600\">Threshold anomaly</span></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Mengorganisir dengan Groups",
          "desc": "Pelajari cara menggunakan Groups untuk mengelola node yang kompleks. Fitur meliputi: grouping node terpilih, ungroup, move-to-group, rename group, color picker untuk group, dan tidy layout dalam group. Groups membuat canvas tetap rapi meskipun puluhan node digunakan.",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 p-4\"><div class=\"p-2 rounded-lg border-2 border-teal-300 bg-teal-50\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-700\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10\"/></svg><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800\">Validasi Pengguna</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-teal-600 pl-6\">3 nodes · Grouped</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-2 pl-6\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-teal-100 rounded text-xs text-teal-700\">Group</span><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-teal-100 rounded text-xs text-teal-700\">Ungroup</span><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-teal-100 rounded text-xs text-teal-700\">Move to</span></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Manajemen Scenario",
          "desc": "Panduan lengkap operasi CRUD untuk scenario: membuat baru (Add New), melihat detail (View), mengedit parameter dan canvas (Edit), mengaktifkan/nonaktifkan (Toggle Active), menghapus (Delete), serta menduplikasi rule yang sudah ada. Pelajari juga cara filter dan search di daftar Scenario Management.",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 p-4\"><div class=\"p-2 bg-orange-50 rounded-lg border border-orange-200 text-center\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 mx-auto mb-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 4v16m8-8H4\"/></svg><span class=\"text-xs text-orange-800\">Create</span></div><div class=\"p-2 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 text-center\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mx-auto mb-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z\"/></svg><span class=\"text-xs text-blue-800\">View</span></div><div class=\"p-2 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg border border-amber-200 text-center\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 mx-auto mb-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z\"/></svg><span class=\"text-xs text-amber-800\">Edit</span></div><div class=\"p-2 bg-red-50 rounded-lg border border-red-200 text-center\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-red-600 mx-auto mb-1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16\"/></svg><span class=\"text-xs text-red-800\">Delete</span></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Operasi Canvas",
          "desc": "Kuasi operasi canvas untuk produktivitas maksimal: clipboard (Ctrl+C/X/V untuk copy/cut/paste node & group), undo/redo (Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Shift+Z dengan 50 langkah history), tidy layout (auto-arrange dengan dagre), dan connected move (node terhubung ikut dipindahkan). Shortcut ini mempercepat workflow secara drastis.",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": "<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-pink-50 rounded-lg border border-pink-200\"><kbd class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-white border border-pink-300 rounded text-xs font-mono text-pink-800\">Ctrl+Z</kbd><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-800\">Undo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-pink-50 rounded-lg border border-pink-200\"><kbd class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-white border border-pink-300 rounded text-xs font-mono text-pink-800\">Ctrl+Shift+Z</kbd><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-800\">Redo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-pink-50 rounded-lg border border-pink-200\"><kbd class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-white border border-pink-300 rounded text-xs font-mono text-pink-800\">Ctrl+C</kbd><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-800\">Copy</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-pink-50 rounded-lg border border-pink-200\"><kbd class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-white border border-pink-300 rounded text-xs font-mono text-pink-800\">Ctrl+V</kbd><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-800\">Paste</span></div></div>"
        }
